WEBVTT

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:46.980
You're Priss, aren't you?

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:02.040
Is this the new moto-slave?

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:05.170
In order to fit your new suit, I had
to make a minor change.

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:06.980
So don't expect too much.

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:08.880
No, that's not true!

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:10.940
The one before was just a vehicle,

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:13.280
but this is...

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.380
I know.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:18.480
This will be a part of my body.

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:23.490
Well now...

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:25.560
Shall we go?

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.570
I'm going by myself.

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:39.630
What the hell are you talking about now?!

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:43.500
You'd be in my way.

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:53.050
Damn, this gun is totally useless!

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:58.650
I understand, but promise me that

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:02.120
you'll come back alive.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:10.710
Idiot!

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:20.420
Priss!

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:26.060
When you come back,

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:28.390
without the helmet, okay?

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:15.640
Damn...

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.130
Linna! Nene!

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.800
What is this?!

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:51.040
This monster is trying to fuse with our suits!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.370
What?! Oh, no!

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:54.880
Sylia!

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:17.400
We can't get close without preparation.

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:21.440
I'm sure if we cut the line
somewhere, it'll stop moving.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:22.410
Then...

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.360
Just as I thought, I have to
cut it off at the bottom!

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:54.200
It hurts.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.170
My body...

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:59.940
I can't take it anymore.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.750
Nene, hold on!

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.650
Linna?

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.050
We'll be all right, Nene.

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:11.820
I know Sylia will rescue us, and Priss will too!

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:16.930
Linna, are you all right?!

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:18.290
Hey, Linna!

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:23.130
I'm fine. I refuse to lose to something like this!

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:26.400
You're right. I'll hang in there!

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.060
What was that? Linna, Nene?

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.890
Priss!

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:42.920
Priss...

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.480
Priss!

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:50.990
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.050
Priss...

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:55.050
Now, what should we do?

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:59.240
The only way to stop it is to cut the line.

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:02.060
Cover me.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:03.570
I'm going in!

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.010
Sylia!

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:05.910
Damn!

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.320
Priss!

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:24.260
That's it!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.630
It doesn't work from the outside!

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:39.530
Sylia!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:01.060
It's so miserable to have to wait

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:02.660
without doing anything, isn't it?

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.670
Trust them. It's also about being brave.

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:09.340
Sure.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:14.080
You've got a good point. I like you.

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:22.190
Would you please allow me to join you?

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:23.150
Mr. Meisio!

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:27.520
There are no other people
left in Tokyo except us.

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:30.490
I felt lonely by myself in my room.

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:37.470
Mr. Meisio, please sit with us.

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:40.770
Thank you for your kindness, Mr. Mackey.

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:43.140
Priss...

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:50.240
Do you think you've stopped me?

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:58.920
Are you two all right?

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:00.580
Yes...

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:02.850
Somehow...

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:05.320
Priss...

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:27.040
Damn!

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:29.590
Damn!

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:29.890
Priss!
Damn!

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:30.580
Priss!

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:34.090
Good!

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:37.350
Just as I thought.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:39.530
Sylia!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.340
Everyone!

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:48.930
Listen, Priss.

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:52.210
Listen to me, everyone.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:56.410
I think you already noticed that our suits

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.680
have been affected by some kind of power.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.710
We're going to use this power.

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:07.160
This worm is just being violent
without any logic to its actions.

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:11.030
So we're going to control it
by imposing our own logic.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:12.760
Control a huge monster like this?

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:15.370
We will! Believe in yourself!

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:16.990
Understood.

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:18.800
Priss!

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:20.500
I understand.

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:43.390
Go!

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:52.530
I see it!

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:08.890
Sylia!

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:10.440
Nene... Linna...

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:12.860
Where's Priss?

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:14.790
Priss!

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:56.430
Cheers!

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.210
I'm home.

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.170
Yeah.

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.410
Here, Nene, you're hungry, aren't you?

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:11.640
Thanks.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:18.350
Geez, am I the only one being left out?

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:21.290
Oh, please have some.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:23.790
Thank you!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:25.990
Please...

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:30.920
Well, it's pretty strange after all.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.300
What is?

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:37.970
Not long ago, I hated the Knight Sabers,

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:42.680
because they dealt with our enemies so easily

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:45.040
even though we had a hard time
handling them ourselves.

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:49.510
But now we're having drinks together.

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:52.990
What do you think of us now?

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:56.390
Well, you sure are incredible.

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:59.830
Actually, I've thought that for a long time.

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:01.690
I've been envious of you.

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:04.360
Say...

00:12:06.440 --> 00:12:08.700
Do you remember that promise?

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:11.760
You know.

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:14.300
Without the helmet?

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:18.750
Silly.

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:22.550
Another drink please.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.580
As I expected.

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:29.450
Mackey, this bacon sandwich is also good.

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:30.820
Here.

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:33.990
Is anything wrong?

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:36.530
It's funny, isn't it?

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:37.230
What?

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.200
Tokyo became the hell it is now,

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:43.300
the people ran away, and
the roads are all closed.

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.910
Actually, we're stuck in a horrible situation.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.710
However, I'm having fun being here like this.

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:55.780
I've never had so much fun in my entire life.

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:57.180
Mackey...

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:00.480
I wonder how long I'll be able to remember this.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.150
Oh yeah, I just remembered,
I have something I must do.

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:05.690
Mackey, hey!

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:08.060
You can't be serious!

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.030
Really?

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:02.150
What are you going to do now?

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:06.890
I will continue our efforts to
resist them from this base.

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:10.490
As I already told you,

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:13.900
I want to find out what the relationship
is between us and our suits.

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:18.330
The relationship with your suits?
Even if there are more victims?

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:19.640
No!

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:20.900
That's not true.

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:23.330
I didn't mean...

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.910
Yeah, I know.

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:27.840
I'm sorry.

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:33.910
Also, I have to settle everything with that girl,

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.080
but until then...

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:47.760
I can't access anything.
This system is such a waste.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.800
Hey, what are you doing?

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:53.900
Back ups.

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:57.340
I want to copy all the data to
media when I have time.

00:14:57.340 --> 00:15:00.540
All of this?! That'll take a huge number of disks!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:03.010
Yes, that's why I do it whenever I have time.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.350
Mackey...

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:16.180
What's the matter? Can't you sleep?

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:19.550
No, I just woke up.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.520
I thought that girl was doing something again.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:27.020
A boomer!

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.150
Where did it come from?

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:33.060
What?!

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:33.400
Oh, no!
What?!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:33.950
Oh, no!

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:36.730
What the hell is that noise?!

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.720
It's an alarm.

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:45.100
Mackey!

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:49.150
Mackey, what are you doing?!

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:50.640
Oh, Nene!

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:52.710
What is it?

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:54.580
Enemies!

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:55.480
Where is everyone?

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.610
It's just us in here.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:01.190
Can you investigate the situation?

00:18:01.190 --> 00:18:02.420
Yes!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.060
What's going on?

00:18:15.100 --> 00:18:17.870
There are boomers on the roof of the building.

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:22.550
Not just on the roof, they've
already invaded the building.

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:23.670
What did you say?

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:30.050
I can't believe it.

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:32.540
The security system here shouldn't
be that easy to penetrate.

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:36.830
Look, there's nothing on the
security camera screens.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:40.030
But there are signs of boomers everywhere.

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:41.960
They're already in the shop!

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:43.900
I understand.

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:48.270
Shut down the building above the shop
as well as the underground facilities.

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:52.870
Shut down complete.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:58.340
No way! I completed the shut down properly.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:01.640
It can't be! Where are they?

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.580
The lower floors...

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:09.490
Oh, no, they invaded this building with ease.

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:12.650
This just can't be!

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:16.860
I see. It's a new idea.

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:21.530
Did I say something?

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:24.770
What?

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.170
An earthquake at a time like this?

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.480
What the hell?

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.950
What was that?

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:35.280
Oh, no! The enemies are coming closer.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.410
They're coming.

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:41.350
They're here!

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:47.600
Damn! Come on, you monsters!

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:48.930
Leon!

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:53.100
I know a gun like this is totally useless, but...

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:57.230
I don't want to wait any longer.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:19:59.840
Leon...

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:01.470
Nene!

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:04.650
No way.

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:06.480
It can't be, but...

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:09.040
They're already in here!

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:14.020
Don't be ridiculous, Nene.

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:15.720
They're definitely not here!

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:17.830
Pull yourself together, Nene!

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:19.660
But...

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:25.030
What's going on?

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:38.310
They're coming from the
swimming pool on the roof.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:59.410
Next Episode

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:03.120
I can't believe this is Tokyo.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:04.790
It's been transformed
into a strange city now.

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:09.030
A gray city with the scars left by
a horrible evil clearly visible.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:10.830
There's no sign of human beings.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:16.100
Only boomers fused with machines make
a little noise as they move at random.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:20.340
We need to run away to some
place they haven't touched yet.

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:22.470
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
